			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Dainsleif"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80030501,
					"content": "Looks like we're here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030502
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030502,
					"content": "An eerie, lifeless, dark chamber... I understand the evil aura you were describing earlier.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030503
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030503,
					"content": "Ohhhh... Such a scary place...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030504
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030504,
					"content": "Be careful to not be overwhelmed by the power of the Defiled Statue— the Abyss Herald, it's here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030505
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030505,
					"content": "Mwahaha... You sense correctly.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030506
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Abyss Herald"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030506,
					"content": "You are just as vexatious as ever, Dainsleif, enemy of the Abyss!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030507
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Abyss Herald"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030507,
					"content": "I sense your soul is stained by terrible bloodshed, perhaps from your darkest nightmares. Unless... Huh?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030508
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Abyss Herald"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030508,
					"content": "Oh, and something far more dangerous! You reek of a corruption familiar to me...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030509
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Abyss Herald"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030509,
					"content": "Then we are the same. We're both dangerous. But dangers from outside of the Abyss Order must be caught and caged...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030510
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Abyss Herald"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030510,
					"content": "Tsk.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030511
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030511,
					"content": "It is your words that forever reek of corruption...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030512
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030512,
					"content": "Time to silence you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Dainsleif"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 800306,
			"completionStepIds": [
				800311
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"800311",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 800311,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Paimon"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 80030601,
					"content": "They... left...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030602
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030602,
					"content": "#Oh, don't be too sad, {NICKNAME}... We'll find them again! Look on the bright side, at least we got some really useful information!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030603,
						80030605
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030603,
					"content": "I'm... not sad.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030604
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030604,
					"content": "Really? You sure...?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030607
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030607,
					"content": "At least now, as well as The Seven, Dain is also a key part of finding your sibling too, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030608,
						80030609
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030608,
					"content": "Once we get to Inazuma, we should keep that in mind as we look for more clues.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030610
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030610,
					"content": "That's right! Um... by the way, what they said just now was all pretty confusing... Did you understand it at all?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030611,
						80030612
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030611,
					"content": "I pretty much got it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030613
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030613,
					"content": "Oh... well then... let's go over it again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030614
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030614,
					"content": "#First off, that Abyss Herald called {F#your brother \"Prince.\"}{M#your sister \"Princess.\"}",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030615
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030615,
					"content": "#It seems like your {F#brother}{M#sister} is leading the Abyss Order, even the Abyss Herald answers to {F#him}{M#her}... Still, we don't know for sure if {F#he's}{M#she's} the highest-ranking leader in the organization.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030616
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030616,
					"content": "#Also, your {F#brother}{M#sister} said that {F#he}{M#she} wants to \"engulf the thrones\" and go to \"war with destiny.\" What the heck does that mean? ...Could it be {F#he}{M#that she} wants to destroy The Seven and the seven nations?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030617
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030617,
					"content": "Next thing... turns out the Abyss Order monsters are really what the people of Khaenri'ah turned into after their nation was destroyed. This story is just plain terrifying!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030618
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030618,
					"content": "And Dain is from Khaenri'ah, too! He witnessed its destruction 500 years ago. But... he didn't turn into a monster, and now he's fighting the Abyss Order...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030619
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030619,
					"content": "#So that's why {F#your brother}{M#your sister} said that Dain is {F#his}{M#her} enemy, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030620
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030620,
					"content": "But... If the monsters of the Abyss are the same people that Dain protected all those years ago, then why is he enemies with the Abyss Order now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030621
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030621,
					"content": "#Also, how come... after all this time we've spent searching for {F#your brother}{M#your sister}, it turns out {F#he's}{M#she's} on the side of the Abyss. What's up with that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030622,
						80030623
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 80030622,
					"content": "We have many new questions, but few answers.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						80030624
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 80030624,
					"content": "Yeah, you're right.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
